   "caption": "Leakage with the real model, re-measured on the finale code: {{e1_isolation.sessions+}} leaked. The controls built to leak did: {{e1_positive.history}} and {{e1_positive.gateway+}}. The upper bound is {{e1_bound.sessions+}}."},
  {"key": "w12", "visual": {"kind": "slide", "page": 6},
   "caption": "The result that changed. With the stub, 250 ms padding reached {{timing_stub.acc250+}}. Against the real model it leaked: {{timing_250_real.acc+}}. We found this ourselves."},
  {"key": "w13", "visual": {"kind": "slide", "page": 6},
   "caption": "Deadline release fixed it: {{timing_deadline_real.acc+}}, against {{timing_deadline_real.base+}}. One execution gave {{timing_deadline_real.p3+}}, below 0.05 but above the pre-declared {{timing_deadline_real.alpha+}}, so the verdict is no leak detected. The cost is {{timing_deadline_cost.cost+}}."},
